{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358436-ex3-combat-slight-modification-question","id":1358436,"title":"Ex3 Combat - slight modification question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-02T10:07:24-08:00","id":1358436,"title":"Ex3 Combat - slight modification question","content":"Hello Forumites!<br /> <br /> I was wondering if I &quot;unhooked&quot; Withering with the Initiative system and made it as a stand alone &quot;scene resource gathering&quot; (add, subtract). I would resolve the initiative &quot;regular&quot; style.<br /> <br /> Withering would add substract &quot;resources&quot; so that Decisive could occur. <br /> <br /> I'm wondering (constructively of course) what would break in the system. Having the Golden Rule also in mind, the Storyteller system is flexible and that's how I like it.<br /> <br /> The Resource pools would be dice in the middle of the group that players could add after their withering actions. They could also substract the dice pools of NPCs (and also by extension) have their pools reduced depending on actions from the Narative (the Storyteller) or NPCs actions against them.<br /> <br /> Let me know your thoughts.<br /> <br /> Best regards, and Happy New Year 2020! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-02T10:14:13-08:00","id":1358439,"title":"","content":"Hi Pram!<br /> <br /> Great question. It's